{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_04",
  "title": "重回正轨",
  "storyCode": "RS-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "905b9c5cc2efc341719f7c1ab0aa87926fc81d769ec332ab87c721fd6c90a91e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "葫芦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "同花顺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "*维多利亚粗口*，你小子是不是藏牌了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "对付你还用得着藏牌？得了，乖乖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "皇家同花顺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "*维多利亚俚语*，怎么可能？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "杰克，你的袖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "啊？我——你怎么发现的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "杰克，你这*维多利亚名词*，你骗我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "你没发现，那就是你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "*维多利亚问候语*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "洗牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "得了，洗牌洗牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "啧，老子真是倒了霉，今天跟你一起轮班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "跟谁轮班还不都是打牌，弟兄们有几个打牌不会出千，你数数吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "不过，这日子过得倒还真是悠哉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "你还别说，老大当时说要带我们来观光的时候，我是真不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "结果来了一个月，我现在信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "吃得也好，喝得也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "可不是，我感觉我的胃口都回到刚入伍那时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "嘶——啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "查理斯，你鬼叫什么呢，吓我一跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "*维多利亚俚语*，我又做噩梦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "梦见我被萨卡兹一剑砍成两半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "嘁，我还以为多大事呢。我前天还梦到自己侦察的时候被源石炸药炸得粉碎呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "我现在就想找块炸药塞你嘴里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "你赶紧去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "一个上了战场比*维多利亚粗口*血魔还疯的家伙，下了战场比谁都矫情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "我有什么办法，我又不能控制做不做噩梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "往好了想，你上次说你是被砍成肉沫，这次只是被砍成两半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "说不定是好兆头呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "......*维多利亚粗口*，还挺有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "得了，喝一口起来打牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "哦，你醒了正好，来替我打几局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "怎么，有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "......没什么，山下有个农民家里缺干农活的，我去帮个忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "农民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "经常给我们送奶的那一户，老图里尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "哦，我记起来了，那户人家的女儿挺漂亮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "啧啧，看不出来啊，里斯本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "......只是去帮个忙，别想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "干什么呢，隔几百米都能听到你们一群老油子嚷嚷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "挺有本事啊你们几个，军营都要成你们的棋牌室了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "这不是您老人家一开始就跟我们说是来观光的吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "我们这叫遵守命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我还让你们去给当地人做做亲善工作，免得别人觉得我们是一群坏种，你们去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "里斯本这不正要去吗，我看他别说去了，都想在这成家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "头儿，别听他胡扯，就是去帮个忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "毕竟咱们终究是来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "别废话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "滚吧，什么时候轮到你操心了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "你小子要真能成家，还算你有本事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "头儿，你身上的味儿可真重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "又去锻炼你那兽医技术了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "别提了，老雷昂家的莉莉早产了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我没赶上，只能去帮忙做一些产后护理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "唉，还遇到个晦气的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "晦气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "老乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "老乡？我这一个月见到的来观光的维多利亚人没有一千也有八百了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "行了，就你最爱上街溜达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "发牌发牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "头儿，查理斯刚才又做噩梦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "小事，哪里用得着麻烦您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "你们死了，谁来帮我打仗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "......还会打吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "先闭嘴，忍一忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "嗯......确实没有恶化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "现在还像过去那么疼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "自从来了谢拉格，比过去好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "哼，这可是我花了大钱打点关系才搞来的机会，要是对你们的身体没好处，那我不就白花钱了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "不过，在这里最多也只是疗养就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我知道，头儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "我这条手臂早就废了，也就您还会帮我照看两下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "不过就算我两条手臂都废了，只剩下一张嘴，我也能咬着武器上战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "一个没有手的士兵能做到什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "逞强没有意义，你们只需要记住，你们是来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "容我再次提醒您，子爵阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "请记住您身负的职责，不要辜负公爵阁下的期望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "这并非一场观光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "喂，头儿，头儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "终于老年痴呆了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我跟你们这群根本不爱惜自己身体的蠢货可不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "等你们老年痴呆了我都不会老年痴呆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "嘿，我们可活不到那个时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "罢了罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "为了我的养老计划，只能把这张老脸豁出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "头儿，你说什么胡话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "按谢拉格人的审美，他们可不会喜欢你这种油腻贵族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "但是没有人会拒绝一场盛大的宴会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "你们打吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "该不会是牌太烂了才找了个借口开溜吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "让我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "四张J，不好不坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哈！好酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "这就是恩希欧迪斯特地送过来，说要在仪式前夜的篝火晚会上做宣传的，那什么、什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷，是“圣山庄园·雪境之春”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "这段时间电视里头天天放，搞得我都记住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哗众取宠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "嗯，但这酒滋味确实不差，够带劲，算是他恩希欧迪斯难得做了件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "不过，我们自家的陈酿也不比这酒差！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷，那我们还继续喝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "算上布朗陶家弄来的，后头还有三种酒水备选呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "自然继续！不亲自试试，怎么知道哪种最好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "圣女大人既然把这次晚会交给我佩尔罗契家筹办，那我就得负起责任来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "酒水是重中之重，我得选出我们谢拉格最好的酒水宴客，务必不让圣女大人失望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "去，把剩下的几种酒水也一起抬上来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "来人！跟我去搬酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "将军，我有个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "虽然老爷刚才说了是为庆典做准备，但最近运来的酒是不是太多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "弟兄们都要累瘫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "想那么多干什么，耶拉冈德像落成这么大的事，多少酒都不够用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "让弟兄们忍一忍，等忙完了我请你们吃顿好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "好嘞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（佩尔罗契家的人或许多留些心眼会好一些。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（连我自己都没想到，混进来会这么简单。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（那位老家主已经带着罗莎琳小姐往这边来了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（接下来就让我看看，佩尔罗契家的葫芦里，究竟卖的什么药吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（而且——大量的酒......可阿克托斯的架势，真的是用来开宴会的？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（也是一条线索。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "磨磨唧唧的在干什么呢，快过来帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（不过，如果佩尔罗契家真的有什么不可告人的秘密，那么这个秘密也一定与罗莎琳小姐脱不了干系。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护卫？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "（先以她那边为优先吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我们到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯，这是你家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好大的房子，看不出来，原来你这么有钱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "不至于，只是略有家底罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "咳嗯，小姑娘，你瞧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "这房子依山而建，明日你要上山，便可走这屋宅后方的近道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "多谢你啊，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小姑娘，我要先和你道歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了，这么突然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我邀请你来做客，是存了一份私心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上，此事、此事我不该瞒你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......什么事这么严肃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你说吧，老伯，我听着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "好孩子，好孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "有一个人，我想让你见一见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "大老爷？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那边有个大个子在喊你呢，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那是你儿子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我可没这样的儿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小姑娘，你等我片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "大老爷，您怎么忽然回来了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......怎么，我不能回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "我不是那个意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "只是，唉，您这来的时间不巧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "有什么巧不巧的，我想什么时候回来，还轮不到你小子来多嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你们老爷人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷他、他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "吞吞吐吐像什么样子！说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷他正在为明天的篝火晚会做准备！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "别光拣好听的说，还有呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......老爷他，一定要亲自为明日的酒水把关，正在品尝各地送来的酒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "这臭小子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "他上个月才说戒酒，如今就这般，简直荒唐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "如此朝令夕改，往后哪里还有半点威信可言？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷这也是为了国事着想，是对圣女大人一片忠心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "哼！我看他就是管不住自己的嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "哈哈......对了，这位姑娘是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "古罗小子，不得无礼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小姑娘叫罗莎琳，是我的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "罗莎琳小姐，欢迎欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "（大老爷，这位罗莎琳小姐究竟是什么人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "（怎么看着，这么像老——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "（住口！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "（......这事还没个定数，你先别多问。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "古罗，你带小姑娘先进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "去......阿克托斯那混账在哪，就带她去哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "还有，吩咐下头的人备好客房和饭食，一定要好生招待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "让你久等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你们聊完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "刚刚这个大个子出来之前，老伯你想和我说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你想让我见谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......我希望你见的人，便在屋内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "先和这大个子一起进去吧，罗莎琳，待那人见到你，就什么都明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那你呢，老伯，你不和我们一起吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我们很快会再见的，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "很快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "请吧，罗莎琳小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哎这位大哥，你叫古罗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你们家这老爷子刚刚和你嘀嘀咕咕的，你俩都聊了点啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "是什么不能告诉我的内容？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "兄弟，说句话呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "（双手食指比叉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "真不能说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "（反复比叉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔......好吧，不为难你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "反正一会见到人就知道了，是吧？我也怪好奇的，到底是什么原因，让你们一个两个都只顾盯着我的脸看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "怎么，是我长得像谁，还是谁长得像我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "该不会，老伯说想要我见的人就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "这、不是，没有......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘁，行了，你这人一看就不会说谎话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "说真的，你们的眼神真的蛮怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "要不是知道你们没坏心思，我都要忍不住动手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不是要进去吗，那就走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "哎！罗莎琳小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老爷，大老爷他带了客人回来......\n老爷？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哇哈哈哈！好酒，好酒啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "来，一起干了这杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "这就是老伯想让我见的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "一个......大胡子醉鬼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哪里来的小丫头，胡说什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "我佩尔罗契家家主阿克托斯，怎么可能因为这点酒就醉了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "醉鬼一般都这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我本来还以为......但不应该啊，我爹应该很帅才对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "你是父亲的客人，嗝，我不同你计较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "小丫头，你站过来点，让我仔细瞧瞧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你、你要干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "我......我应该认得你的脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "咳、咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人步入室内，惊起厚重的灰尘。\n门扉摇摇欲坠，地板嘎吱作响。\n在他自己的命令下，这间屋子已经太久没有迎来任何一位客人了。\n无人居住的房屋，与无人牵挂的人一样，都在不知不觉间衰老。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我把它放在哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我把它放在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......没错，是在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人摸索着打开角落中的木柜，从中取出某样物件。\n那是一块无华的石块，被精心磨平所有棱角，打磨至圆润无缺。\n在石块上，刻着代表耶拉冈德祝福的图案。\n老人将这块他亲自求来的石块握在掌心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "还好，还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我收着它，却没想到能有今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "塔季扬娜，罗莎琳是个好孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人记得，那也是个冬天。\n他便是透过这扇窗户，注视着窗外压抑无声的别离。\n他看着那年轻的、来自异国、没有犯任何过错的女人，带着能点燃冰雪的愤怒与失望离去。\n他看着那年幼懵懂的稚童，被女人抱在怀中，尚不理解母亲怒容的来由。\n老人看了许久许久。\n直到两人的背影在风雪中逐渐淡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "这么多年，时间就这么过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "当年我本想将它送给罗莎琳，却不料......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "当年阿克托斯不愿看你们受非难，是我强行将他关入柴房，令他不得为你说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "而后，也是我，是我为佩尔罗契家，放逐了你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "塔季扬娜，你若有怨，便怨我好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "如今，佩尔罗契家已交付到阿克托斯手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "谢拉格也与曾经大不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我立下誓言，如今便做寻常修士，只要在世一日，便为耶拉冈德清扫路面一日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "若那时便能如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "竟做起这种梦，我也真是老了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
